  "Stratholme (58–60): entra una volta, con tutte le quest.",
  "The Shaper's Terrace (58–60): entra una volta, con tutte le quest.",
  "^ability_parry^Talent: Deflection 1/5 +5% Parry (46–50): ponte verso Improved Tactical Mastery e Anger Management.",
  "Prendi il Flight Path: Tainted Foothills",
  "^ability_parry^Talent: Deflection 2/5 +5% Parry (46–50): ponte verso Improved Tactical Mastery e Anger Management.",
  "Journeyman Riding (circa 1000 g): mount veloce.",
  "Shield Specialization:Protection;Shield Specialization:Protection;Shield Specialization:Protection;Shield Specialization:Protection;Shield Specialization:Protection;Improved Revenge:Protection;Improved Revenge:Protection;Improved Revenge:Protection;Improved Thunder Clap:Protection;Improved Thunder Clap:Protection;Master of Defense:Protection;Master of Defense:Protection;Last Stand:Protection;Improved Thunder Clap:Protection;Defiance:Protection;Vanguard:Protection;Defiance:Protection;Defiance:Protection;Improved Bloodrage:Protection;Improved Bloodrage:Protection;Concussion Blow:Protection;Focused Rage:Protection;Focused Rage:Protection;Focused Rage:Protection;Improved Shield Wall:Protection;Bastion:Protection;Bastion:Protection;Bastion:Protection;Bastion:Protection;Bastion:Protection;Shield Slam:Protection;Cruelty:Fury;Cruelty:Fury;Cruelty:Fury;Cruelty:Fury;Cruelty:Fury;Lingering Rage:Fury;Lingering Rage:Fury;Lingering Rage:Fury;Lingering Rage:Fury;Lingering Rage:Fury;Enrage:Fury;Enrage:Fury;Enrage:Fury;Enrage:Fury;Enrage:Fury;Improved Rend:Arms;Improved Rend:Arms;Improved Rend:Arms;Deflection:Arms;Deflection:Arms",
  "1Talents: Protection 1–60",
  "0{Scelta:} Protection (one-hand + shield) è la spec da solo più consigliata: Mobalytics ha la guida Warrior più salvata proprio su Protection (KallTorak, 138 ), Icy Veins la chiama \"the fastest Warrior spec for leveling\" e la raccomanda (snippet), Zockify (28 ott) la dà più forte fino al ~40, e wowforever.be (client 1.60.1.70707) costruisce tutta la rotta 10–40 su Protection. L’ordine 10–60 è quello della «Protection 1-60» di Ahlaundoh, la guida Warrior più votata (165 ). Condizioni: Revenge sfrutta block/dodge/parry, Shield Specialization e Master of Defense danno Rage dai colpi subiti, ed è sicura nei pack. Arms (due mani) resta la scelta per gruppo/duo (Method, Icy Veins, Mobalytics Ahlaundoh 165 , agg. 6 nov); Fury non decolla prima del 36–40.",
  "0Calcolatore di wowforever.be con i dati del client 1.60.1.70707, caricato con {questa} build al livello impostato. Tocca un talent per il tooltip.",
  "2Ordine dei talent point",
