  "Improved Frostbolt:Frost;Improved Frostbolt:Frost;Improved Frostbolt:Frost;Improved Frostbolt:Frost;Improved Frostbolt:Frost;Precision:Frost;Precision:Frost;Precision:Frost;Frostbite:Frost;Frostbite:Frost;Ice Lance:Frost;Ice Shards:Frost;Ice Shards:Frost;Ice Shards:Frost;Ice Shards:Frost;Ice Block:Frost;Shatter:Frost;Shatter:Frost;Shatter:Frost;Ice Shards:Frost;Fingers of Frost:Frost;Fingers of Frost:Frost;Cold Snap:Frost;Improved Cone of Cold:Frost;Improved Cone of Cold:Frost;Winter's Chill:Frost;Winter's Chill:Frost;Winter's Chill:Frost;Winter's Chill:Frost;Winter's Chill:Frost;Ice Barrier:Frost;Improved Cone of Cold:Frost;Frostbite:Frost;Frost Channeling:Frost;Frost Channeling:Frost;Frost Channeling:Frost;Improved Blizzard:Frost;Improved Blizzard:Frost;Improved Blizzard:Frost;Improved Channeling:Arcane;Improved Channeling:Arcane;Improved Channeling:Arcane;Improved Channeling:Arcane;Improved Channeling:Arcane;Missile Barrage:Arcane;Arcane Subtlety:Arcane;Arcane Subtlety:Arcane;Arcane Concentration:Arcane;Arcane Concentration:Arcane;Arcane Concentration:Arcane;Arcane Concentration:Arcane",
  "1Talents: Frost 1–60",
  "0{Scelta:} Frost fino al 48, poi Arcane per il Mana: è la build della guida mago più salvata su Mobalytics (Asuna_qt, {112 preferiti}, agg. 4 nov), con l’ordine completo 10–60. Fino al 30 è quasi uguale a {wowforever.be} (letta dal client): Precision 3/3 subito (niente Miss sui mob del tuo livello), Ice Lance al 20, Ice Block al 25, Shatter e Fingers of Frost. Warcraft Tavern la definisce “la build Frost più forte al 30”.",
  "0{Improved Frostbolt} 5/5 · liv. 10–14",
