  "Thundering Strikes:Enhancement;Thundering Strikes:Enhancement;Thundering Strikes:Enhancement;Thundering Strikes:Enhancement;Thundering Strikes:Enhancement;Mental Dexterity:Enhancement;Mental Dexterity:Enhancement;Mental Dexterity:Enhancement;Ancestral Knowledge:Enhancement;Ancestral Knowledge:Enhancement;Shamanistic Focus:Enhancement;Elemental Weapons:Enhancement;Elemental Weapons:Enhancement;Elemental Weapons:Enhancement;Ancestral Knowledge:Enhancement;Stormstrike:Enhancement;Improved Ghost Wolf:Enhancement;Improved Ghost Wolf:Enhancement;Flurry:Enhancement;Flurry:Enhancement;Improved Stormstrike:Enhancement;Improved Stormstrike:Enhancement;Tidal Focus:Restoration;Tidal Focus:Restoration;Tidal Focus:Restoration;Tidal Focus:Restoration;Tidal Focus:Restoration;Mindfulness:Restoration;Mindfulness:Restoration;Mindfulness:Restoration;Totemic Focus:Restoration;Totemic Focus:Restoration;Water Shield:Restoration;Mental Quickness:Enhancement;Mental Quickness:Enhancement;Flurry:Enhancement;Maelstrom Weapon:Enhancement;Maelstrom Weapon:Enhancement;Maelstrom Weapon:Enhancement;Maelstrom Weapon:Enhancement;Maelstrom Weapon:Enhancement;Rage of the Farseer:Enhancement;Spirit Weapons:Enhancement;Flurry:Enhancement;Flurry:Enhancement;Ancestral Knowledge:Enhancement;Ancestral Knowledge:Enhancement;Concussion:Elemental;Concussion:Elemental;Concussion:Elemental;Concussion:Elemental",
  "1Talents: Enhancement 1–60",
  "0{Scelta:} Enhancement (2H, melee + totem) è la spec di leveling in solitaria su cui convergono Method (Erik, agg. 23 ott: \"la più forte\"), Warcraft Tavern (\"la via più pulita\"), Mobalytics Tiqqle ({175 }, Verified, agg. 6 nov: la guida Shaman più salvata) e wowforever.be (dati client). Ordine di Tiqqle: Thundering Strikes, Mental Dexterity, Ancestral Knowledge, Shamanistic Focus al 20, Elemental Weapons, Stormstrike al 25, Improved Ghost Wolf, Flurry; dal 32 undici punti in Restoration (Tidal Focus, Mindfulness, Totemic Focus) per {Water Shield} al 42, come NickTew (67 ). Il Mana è il vero limite: Elemental e Resto sono più lenti da soli.",
