  "0Mobalytics – yumytv, Druid Leveling Guide 1-60 – BUILD A · 87 · agg. 4 nov · 9/31/11 a 60 · Ferocity 3 (10–12), Furor 5 (13–17), Feral Swiftness 2 (18–19) · Sharpened Claws · Sharpened Claws 2/2, Savage Fury 2, Feral Charge (24), Predatory Discipline, Blood Frenzy 2, Predatory Strikes 2, Leader of the Pack al 30; Shifting Power al 40",
