  "0{Orc Warrior:} Blood Fury +10% Attack Power/Spell Power per 15 s (tooltip: 2 min CD; note 16 ott: 3 min ), Hardiness -20% durata stun, Shatter Curse, Command (inutile). Savage rimosso.",
