  "0{Troll Priest:} Horde. Hex of Weakness (10, 43 AP, 20% heal ricevuti) e Shadowguard (20, 3 cariche 10 min), Berserking (+10% cast speed 15 s), Beast Slaying (“gains a lot of value while leveling”, DoubleZug), Rapid Regeneration. CC: “Best”.",
