  "^spell_nature_regeneration^Trainer: Mark of the Wild, Wrath, Healing Touch",
  "Trainer di classe Tauren: Gart Mistrunner (Red Cloud Mesa, Mulgore) o Gennia Runetotem (Bloodhoof Village).",
  "^spell_nature_starfall^Trainer: Moonfire, Rejuvenation",
  "Bag da 6 slot (Grace of An'she and Mu'sha): Seer Graytongue, Red Cloud Mesa. Porta l'incenso al santuario prima dello scadere del timer.",
  "The Adventurer (Chief Hawkwind, Camp Narache, liv. 6), poi The Great Outdoors (Kaga Wildhoof, Bloodhoof Village): sblocca Camping.",
  "^spell_nature_thorns^Trainer: Thorns",
  "Camping 101: Cooking da Kaga Wildhoof: sblocca Basic Campfire.",
  "^spell_nature_stranglevines^Trainer: Entangling Roots",
  "^ability_racial_bearform^Trainer: Bear Form, Growl, Maul, Demoralizing Roar, Nature's Grasp, Teleport: Moonglade",
  "Heeding the Call (Tauren, livello 10): parla con Gennia Runetotem a Bloodhoof Village. Poi parla con Turak Runetotem sull'Elder Rise di Thunder Bluff. Ricompensa: Bear Form.",
  "^spell_nature_resistnature^Trainer: Regrowth, Revive, Enrage",
  "^spell_nature_nullifypoison^Trainer: Cure Poison, Bash",
  "Cozy Sleeping Bag: catena lunga e facoltativa.",
  "Lessons Anew (Tauren, livello 14, Cure Poison): parla con Turak Runetotem sull'Elder Rise. Usa Teleport: Moonglade e parla con Dendrite Starblaze a Nighthaven. Ricompensa: Cure Poison .",
  "^ability_druid_aquaticform^Trainer: Aquatic Form, Swipe",
  "A Lesson to Learn (Tauren, livello 16, Aquatic Form): parla con Turak Runetotem sull'Elder Rise. Usa Teleport: Moonglade e parla con Dendrite Starblaze a Nighthaven. Ricompensa: Aquatic Form (Idol of Shifting Tides ).",
  "^spell_nature_faeriefire^Trainer: Faerie Fire, Hibernate",
  "^ability_druid_catform^Trainer: Cat Form, Claw, Prowl, Rip, Shred, Starfire, Rebirth, Omen of Clarity, Polearms",
  "The Great Cat Spirit (Tauren, livello 20, Cat Form): parla con Turak Runetotem sull'Elder Rise. Usa Teleport: Moonglade e parla con Dendrite Starblaze. Vai nel sud di Moonglade dal Great Cat Spirit. Recupera le tre reliquie allo Stormrage Barrow Den e riportale allo spirito. Ricompensa: Cat Form .",
  "^ability_hunter_beastsoothe^Trainer: Soothe Animal",
