  "A Difficult Path (1) poi Rediscovering the Light (2) e Coming to Terms / Continue Your Training (4): catena di Deathknell. Parti da Shadow Priest Sarvis, poi Aramis Hammerhand.",
  "^spell_holy_fistofjustice^Trainer: Blessing of Might, Judgement",
