  "^spell_holy_mindsooth^Trainer: Concentration Aura, Seal of Justice",
  "A Curious Pair (22, Trevan Rol, The Sepulcher), A Grim Fate (22, Deathguard Baldren, The Sepulcher), Diplomatic Incident (22, Danitha Morr, Bandarion Keep): quest di classe Undead da fare dal 22.",
  "^spell_holy_turnundead^Trainer: Turn Undead",
  "Catena arma Undead: The Moonsilver Blade (25, Ott a Tarren Mill), A Moon-Kissed Blade (25, Lumina Windsinger, The Sepulcher), poi Old Fire-Eye (26, Lumina Windsinger, The Sepulcher). Alternativa dal 22: The Wrath of Rath'mael (Ruins of Lordaeron, Deathguard Kristof a Brill).",
