  "Summon Warhorse: The Tome of Nobility (Duthorian Rall, Stormwind; passi con Arthur the Faithful e Brandur Ironhammer). Apprentice Riding, Dual Talent Specialization. Hammer of the Righteous , Unsealed Wrath . Armatura Plate.",
