  "Dark Sacrifice (20): quest razziale Undead. Prendila da Aelthalyste (Undercity), Miles Welsh (Spirit Rise) o Ur'kyo (Rocktusk Farm). Ricompensa: Dark Sacrifice (perdi vita, guadagni mana).",
  "0{Undead Priest:} Horde. Touch of Weakness (10) e Dark Sacrifice ( 20: perdi vita, guadagni mana + Spirit), Cannibalize (usabile in combat: sustain fortissimo), Will of the Forsaken, Touch of the Grave (drain 30% casters). DoubleZug: “Undead/Troll” per Horde leveling; CC: “Best”.",
