  "08 · {Undercity} · Michael Garrett /way in città · Primo viaggio a Undercity (13–15). Collega Sepulcher e Tarren Mill.",
  "09 · {Tarren Mill (Hillsbrad Foothills)} · Zarise /way 60.2 18.6 · Arrivo a Hillsbrad (19–20). (wmd + games.gg 22 set)",
