  "^inv_spear_07^Trainer: Aimed Shot, Freezing Trap, Aspect of the Cheetah, Disengage",
  "^spell_frost_freezingbreath^Trainer: Frost Trap",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Hunter:} Windshaper (Orda): stessi Wind Blessed, Walk on Air ed Elemental Insight; al posto di Read Ley Line hanno Skysight (+15% velocità per 15 s, 30% con Charged a una elemental convergence). Partono da Zephras Isle con la stessa quest Hunter.",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Rogue:} Windshapers: Wind Blessed (+2% Haste), Walk on Air, Skysight (+15% velocità 15 s ogni 2 min; con Elemental Convergence 'Charged' +30% per 1 ora). Rogue's Diary la mette in S-tier per leveling ('nulla si avvicina'); Warcraft Tavern la considera debole per il Rogue. Fonti in disaccordo ; da verificare in gioco.",
  "^spell_nature_lightning^Trainer: Lightning Bolt, Rockbiter Weapon, Healing Wave",
  "Embracing the Elements (Skyborne): quest di classe da Rorian the Dayseeker (Zephras Isle), consegna a Windshaper Boro e prosegue in Call of Earth.",
  "^spell_nature_earthshock^Trainer: Earth Shock, Stoneskin Totem",
  "Call of Earth (Skyborne): parla con Windshaper Boro a Thendal Grove (Zephras Isle). Porta un Signet of Akir. Trova il Rise of Spirits e bevi l'Earth Sapta. Porta il Rough Quartz a Boro. Ricompensa: Earth Totem .",
  "^spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02^Trainer: Earthbind Totem",
  "^spell_nature_stoneclawtotem^Trainer: Stoneclaw Totem, Lightning Shield",
  "Call of Fire (Skyborne): parla con Aarnor Galestrike o Sessaria Skystride (Zephras Isle). Porta il Torch of the Dormant Flame a Olariaan Swiftburn (Shrine of Flames, Gustberry Lowlands). Uccidi lo Skypriest Faladiel (Gustberry Lowlands) e prendi il Faladiel's Heart. Trova Kuramaa nella casa a Shen'dar Highlands, sconfiggi lo spirito e porta Kuramaa's Mask a Olariaan. Resta al Brazier of Offering: Olariaan avvia il rituale. Porta l'Eternal Flame a Valanaar prima che scada il timer. Ricompensa: Fire Totem .",
  "^spell_nature_spiritwolf^Trainer: Ghost Wolf, Frost Shock, Frostbrand Weapon, Healing Stream Totem, Lesser Healing Wave, Call of the Elements, Totemic Recall",
  "Call of Water: da Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff), stessa catena dei Tauren: Islen Waterseer nei Barrens -> Brine -> 3 waterskin -> Vial of Purest Water -> Shard of Water a Islen -> Water Totem.",
  "^spell_fireresistancetotem_01^Trainer: Fire Resistance Totem, Flametongue Totem",
  "Call of Air: da Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff), poi Prate Cloudseer a Thousand Needles -> Air Totem.",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Shaman:} Horde (Windshaper), Zephras Isle: Walk on Air (caduta), Skysight +15% velocità 15 s (30% con Charged per 1 h presso un elemental convergence), Wind Blessed +2% Haste, Elemental Insight +5% danno agli Elementali. Trainer: Windshaper Boro (Thendal Village 42.8, 23.6). Rankedboost (snippet): B.",
  "^ability_warrior_decisivestrike^Trainer: Slam, Cleave, Victory Rush, Retaliation, Dual Wield",
  "^ability_warrior_shieldwall^Trainer: Shield Wall",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Warrior:} Windshaper: Wind Blessed, Elemental Insight, Walk on Air e Skysight (+15% velocità 15 s, 30% se Charged, 2 min CD) invece di Read Ley Line.",
