  "0{Choice:} Protection (one-hand + shield) is the most recommended solo spec: the most saved Warrior guide on Mobalytics is a Protection guide (KallTorak, 138 ), Icy Veins calls it \"the fastest Warrior spec for leveling\" and recommends it (snippet), Zockify (Oct 28) rates it strongest up to ~40, and wowforever.be (client 1.60.1.70707) builds its whole 10–40 route on Protection. The 10–60 order is the «Protection 1-60» of Ahlaundoh, the most voted Warrior guide (165 ). Conditions: Revenge uses block/dodge/parry, Shield Specialization and Master of Defense give Rage from hits taken, and it is safe in packs. Arms (two-hand) stays the choice for group/duo (Method, Icy Veins, Mobalytics Ahlaundoh 165 , updated Nov 6); Fury does not take off before 36–40.",
  "0Calculator by wowforever.be with client data 1.60.1.70707, loaded with {this} build at the selected level. Tap a talent for its tooltip.",
  "2Talent point order",
