  "0{Lvl} · {Bag} · {Slot} · {How}",
  "01 · {Book Bag} · 6 · Nibbled-On Book -> Book Return chain (elite according to Method; leprestore: recover the books around Fargodeep Mine). Start: Marshal Dughan, Goldshire /way 42.2 65.8; the first quest drops from kobolds. Method (Oct 28) + leprestore.",
  "09 · {Old Blanchy's Feed Pouch} · 8 · Westfall: Poor Old Blanchy quest (level 14, visible from 9) from Verna Furlbrow, Jansen Stead /way 60 19.4. Bring 8 Handfuls of Oats. In Classic 4 slots, in Forever 8. Method (Oct 28) + leprestore + games.gg",
  "014 · {Cozy Sleeping Bag chain (reward bag)} · 12 · Chain from Nailed Plank, Alexston Farmstead, Westfall /way 37 50 (level 14+). Leprestore lists two 12-slot bags at Stepping Stones pass; Warcraft Tavern doesn't mention the bags. slots not confirmed.",
  "015 · {Hunting Satchel} · 10 · Loch Modan: Vyrin's Revenge, ends at Farstrider Lodge (Vyrin Swiftwind, east of the lake). Method and leprestore: from 15, elite; the Mage v7 guide said 20. level to verify.",
  "018 · {Sida's Bag (Digging Through the Ooze)} · 10 · Wetlands: Digging Through the Ooze (Sida, Menethil Harbor) gives a 10-slot bag. games.gg only.",
