  "Before you leave:Hearthstone at Auberdine before the boat, then at Stormwind.; Camping and Cooking already done on the Teldrassil route (lvl 4–6).; Auberdine Flight Path (Caylais Moonfeather) taken on arrival in Darkshore.; Buzzbox chain finished before boarding the boat (8-slot bag).; Quest:Wizbang's Gunnysack (Buzzbox 525 chain) – Wizbang Cranktoggle, Auberdine (lvl 11–16): 8-slot bag: finish it before leaving Darkshore.; Poor Old Blanchy – Verna Furlbrow, Westfall 1 (Jansen Stead zone) (lvl 14): Old Blanchy's Feed Pouch, 8-slot bag (Elwynn route, lvl 14).; Deadmines (Sentinel Hill quests) – various Sentinel Hill NPCs, Sentinel Hill (lvl 17): The Deadmines opens at 17: pick them all up before going down (Elwynn route, milestone 17).; A Swift Message – Quartermaster Lewis, Stormwind (lvl not found): Alternative to the Stormwind Flight Path; games.gg only .",
  "Get the Flight Path: Sentinel Hill (Thor)",
  "^ability_defend^Trainer: Shield Block, Mocking Blow",
  "Get the Flight Path: Lakeshire (Ariena Stormfeather)",
  "2From Auberdine to Westfall and Redridge by boat",
  "0Ideal at lvl 15–16: close northern Darkshore with the Buzzbox chain and take the boat from Auberdine. At 15 you enter Westfall and follow the Human route. The Deadmines opens at 17 (Elwynn guide) and Redridge is 15–25 (Wowhead map ). Leaving at 15 skips Ashenvale 19–30 and Blackfathom Deeps. Staying in Darkshore until 19 instead leads to Ashenvale, which is another Kalimdor zone.",
  "0• Hearthstone at Auberdine before the boat, then at Stormwind.",
  "0• Camping and Cooking already done on the Teldrassil route (lvl 4–6).",
  "0• Auberdine Flight Path (Caylais Moonfeather) taken on arrival in Darkshore.",
  "0• Buzzbox chain finished before boarding the boat (8-slot bag).",
  "0{Pros:} Westfall and Redridge with the Deadmines quests (17–26). Stormwind is the bridge to Ironforge and Loch Modan via the tram. Anyone leaving Darkshore at 15 doesn't need to return to Kalimdor for Ashenvale.\n{Cons:} You miss Ashenvale 19–30, Stonetalon and Blackfathom Deeps (24–32) from the Teldrassil route. You pick up Duskwood and Wetlands only later, from the shared route.",
