  "^spell_nature_ravenform^Talent: Deadly Aspects 1/5 With Aspect of the Hawk active, Auto Shot has 2% per rank (10% at rank 5) to give +30% ranged attack speed for 12 s: it's your base damage. All good sources take it first.",
  "^spell_nature_ravenform^Trainer: Aspect of the Hawk, Track Humanoids, Tame Beast / Beast Training / Feed Pet / Revive Pet / Call Pet / Dismiss Pet",
  "Pet: Taming the Beast from Josephine Carson (Goldshire): gives you a Taming Rod to tame 3 beasts in the zone, one after another (3 quests with the same name; the beast is written in the quest). Then Training the Beast: go to the Pet Trainer in the capital -> learn Tame Beast, Call Pet, Feed Pet, Revive Pet and Beast Training. After that, tame the Pet you want (below).",
