  "Deadly Aspects:Beast Mastery;Deadly Aspects:Beast Mastery;Deadly Aspects:Beast Mastery;Deadly Aspects:Beast Mastery;Deadly Aspects:Beast Mastery;Focused Fire:Beast Mastery;Focused Fire:Beast Mastery;Improved Revive Pet:Beast Mastery;Improved Revive Pet:Beast Mastery;Endurance Training:Beast Mastery;Pathfinding:Beast Mastery;Pathfinding:Beast Mastery;Bestial Swiftness:Beast Mastery;Unleashed Fury:Beast Mastery;Unleashed Fury:Beast Mastery;Summon Hawk:Beast Mastery;Unleashed Fury:Beast Mastery;Unleashed Fury:Beast Mastery;Ferocity:Beast Mastery;Ferocity:Beast Mastery;Intimidation:Beast Mastery;Bestial Discipline:Beast Mastery;Bestial Discipline:Beast Mastery;Ferocity:Beast Mastery;Ferocity:Beast Mastery;Ferocity:Beast Mastery;Frenzy:Beast Mastery;Frenzy:Beast Mastery;Frenzy:Beast Mastery;Frenzy:Beast Mastery;Bestial Wrath:Beast Mastery;Lethal Attacks:Marksmanship;Lethal Attacks:Marksmanship;Lethal Attacks:Marksmanship;Lethal Attacks:Marksmanship;Lethal Attacks:Marksmanship;Careful Aim:Marksmanship;Careful Aim:Marksmanship;Careful Aim:Marksmanship;Careful Aim:Marksmanship;Careful Aim:Marksmanship;Rapid Killing:Marksmanship;Rapid Killing:Marksmanship;Hawk Eye:Marksmanship;Hawk Eye:Marksmanship;Hawk Eye:Marksmanship;Trueshot Aura:Marksmanship;Mortal Shots:Marksmanship;Mortal Shots:Marksmanship;Mortal Shots:Marksmanship;Mortal Shots:Marksmanship",
  "1Talents: Beast Mastery 1–60",
  "0{Choice:} Beast Mastery is the most comfortable spec for solo leveling: Warcraft Tavern, Method (Celz, Oct 21), Zockify (Oct 25) and the most voted Hunter guide on Mobalytics (Feor, {222 }, Verified, updated Nov 7) all pick it, and Feor gives the order level by level from 10 to 60. The Pet holds threat while you shoot from range: few deaths and little downtime. The build follows Feor: Pathfinding at 20–21, Summon Hawk at 25, Intimidation at 30, Bestial Wrath at 40, then 20 points in Marksmanship (31 BM + 20 MM). Recommended Pets: Cat (damage) or Boar (toughness), tamed by level and zone.",
  "0{Deadly Aspects} 5/5 · lvl 10–14",
  "0{Focused Fire} 2/2 · lvl 15–16",
  "0{Improved Revive Pet} 2/2 · lvl 17–18",
