  "^spell_magic_magearmor^Trainer: Blessing of Kings, Consecration, Exorcism, Flash of Light",
  "The Tome of Valor (20, Duthorian Rall in Stormwind or Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge) then The Test of Righteousness (21 from Duthorian Rall, 22 from Jordan Stilwell at Gates of Ironforge). Steps: turn in the Tome, then gather materials from the Deadmines, Shadowfang Keep and Blackfathom Deeps dungeons, plus Bailor's Ore Shipment (22, Bailor Stonehand in Thelsamar). Jordan Stilwell forges the weapon. Reward: Verigan's Fist (2H hammer, final item of the chain, not a quest). Zones: Loch Modan and Westfall.",
