  "^ability_rogue_rupture^Trainer: Rupture, Poisons (quest)",
  "Poison quest (Alliance): 1) Mathias and the Defias (20) from Master Mathias Shaw (SI:7 HQ, Valley of Heroes). 2) Klaven's Tower (24) from Agent Kearnen (Westfall, east of Sentinel Hill). Steal the Defias Tower Key from a Malformed Drone (level 23) near the entrance, climb the tower, stun or kill Klaven (elite 24) and open the chest. 3) The Touch of Zanzil (20) is optional: it removes the curse. 4) Return to Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind: from here you can buy the poisons. Alliance is easier.",
