  "^ability_warrior_challange^Talent: Riposte 1/1 150% damage hit + Disarm 6 s after a Parry; Rogue's Diary considered it the best leveling talent before Endurance. Put it in a macro with Sinister Strike.",
  "^ability_rogue_distract^Trainer: Distract, Vanish",
  "Tip (Warcraft Tavern): do the Poison quest from 22, not earlier, because you need Lockpicking 70 and a character strong enough for the elites.",
