  "Remorseless Attacks:Assassination;Remorseless Attacks:Assassination;Efficient Strikes:Combat;Efficient Strikes:Combat;Coup de Grace:Combat;Coup de Grace:Combat;Coup de Grace:Combat;Deflection:Combat;Deflection:Combat;Deflection:Combat;Precision:Combat;Precision:Combat;Riposte:Combat;Precision:Combat;Endurance:Combat;Endurance:Combat;Lightning Reflexes:Combat;Weapon Expertise:Combat;Weapon Expertise:Combat;Aggression:Combat;Aggression:Combat;Aggression:Combat;Blade Flurry:Combat;Dual Wield Specialization:Combat;Dual Wield Specialization:Combat;Hack and Slash:Combat;Hack and Slash:Combat;Flash of Steel:Combat;Flash of Steel:Combat;Flash of Steel:Combat;Flash of Steel:Combat;Flash of Steel:Combat;Adrenaline Rush:Combat;Hack and Slash:Combat;Hack and Slash:Combat;Hack and Slash:Combat;Malice:Assassination;Malice:Assassination;Malice:Assassination;Improved Slice and Dice:Assassination;Improved Slice and Dice:Assassination;Improved Slice and Dice:Assassination;Malice:Assassination;Malice:Assassination;Vigor:Assassination;Vigor:Assassination;Blood Splatter:Assassination;Lethality:Assassination;Lethality:Assassination;Cold Blood:Assassination;Flawless Execution:Combat",
  "1Talents: Combat 1–60",
  "0{Choice:} All sources pick Combat for solo leveling: Warcraft Tavern (Nevermore), Method (Reholy, Oct 9), wowforever.be (client), Mobalytics (DonTheCrown 37 , Rogue's Diary 28 ), the official WoW Forever channel and the most-watched videos (Ragequitting 69k, Gaunerh 65k, DonTheCrown 62k views). Combat has Blade Flurry (cleave) and Adrenaline Rush, uses any weapon thanks to Hack and Slash, and Sinister Strike + Slice and Dice + Eviscerate are easy to play. Since 3 November the Combat tree is different (Improved Sinister Strike and Improved Eviscerate are now called Efficient Strikes and Coup de Grace, Dual Wield Specialization has 2 ranks, Flash of Steel boosts the new Shank): since Nov 6 the order is Mobalytics Djexde's (upd. Nov 5), with the same 16/35/0 split as Rogue’s Diary (upd. Nov 4): Remorseless Attacks first, Endurance at 24–25, Blade Flurry at 32, Adrenaline Rush at 42. The dagger variant (Puncturing Wounds, wowforever.gg) is build C.",
