  "0^ability_rogue_ambush,spell_shadow_lifedrain,ability_vanish^Ambush -> Hemorrhage -> Vanish",
  "0Choose target and opener before the pull (wowforever.gg). Ambush from Stealth with Improved Ambush 3/3 (from 20). Vanish to get out if it goes badly.",
