  "^spell_shadow_abominationexplosion^Trainer: Corruption, Curse of Weakness",
  "The Stolen Tome (Human, level 4): talk to Drusilla La Salle, Northshire Abbey. Recover the Powers of the Void for her. Reward: Summon Imp .",
  "^spell_shadow_burningspirit^Trainer: Life Tap",
