  "^spell_shadow_abominationexplosion^Talent: Improved Corruption 1/5 5 ranks = instant Corruption (2 s cast) and +10% damage: you apply it on the move to every mob. All sources take it first.",
  "^spell_shadow_haunting^Trainer: Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, Summon Voidwalker",
  "Gakin's Summons (Human, level 10): talk to Remen Marcot in Goldshire, then report back to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind. Then Surena Caledon: recover Surena's Choker for Gakin (area Brackwell Pumpkin Patch ). Return to Gakin and do The Binding: use the Bloodstone Choker to summon and subjugate a Voidwalker, then bring the choker back to Gakin. Unlocks Summon Voidwalker .",
