  "^spell_shadow_callofbone^Talent: Grim Reach 1/2 +10/20% range on Affliction spells (Corruption, Bane of Agony, Drain). It replaced Malediction in the Oct 15 notes; costs 2 points but opens row 2.",
  "^spell_shadow_summonsuccubus^Trainer: Summon Succubus, Summon Incubus, Demon Armor, Ritual of Summoning, Curse of the Elements, Rain of Fire",
  "Devourer of Souls (Alliance, level 20): talk to Gakin the Darkbinder, then to Takar the Seer in the Barrens. Get the Heartswood in Ashenvale (31 31 ) and bring it to Gakin in the Mage Quarter. Then The Binding (Heartswood Core): summon and subjugate a Succubus, bring the core back to Gakin (The Slaughtered Lamb). Reward: Summon Succubus .",
  "The Orb of Soran'ruk (from Doan Karhan, The Barrens 49.2 57.2): bring 3 Soran'ruk Fragments from the Twilight Acolytes in Blackfathom Deeps and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment from the Shadowfang Darksoul in Shadowfang Keep. Choose between Staff of Soran'ruk (2H) and Orb of Soran'ruk (off-hand).",
  "^spell_shadow_callofbone^Talent: Grim Reach 2/2 +10/20% range on Affliction spells (Corruption, Bane of Agony, Drain). It replaced Malediction in the Oct 15 notes; costs 2 points but opens row 2.",
