  "Seeking Strahad: talk to Gakin the Darkbinder (Stormwind), Gan'rul Bloodeye (Orgrimmar) or Carendin Halgar (Undercity). Find Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. Then Tome of the Cabal: Alliance from Krom Stoutarm (Ironforge), Horde from Jorah Annison (Undercity) . Ingredients : Moldy Tome (Hillsbrad), Tattered Manuscript (Thousand Needles), 3 Rod of Channeling from the Dragonmaw (Wetlands).",
  "The Binding (Felhunter): use the Tome of the Cabal to summon and subjugate a Felhunter, then bring the tome back to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. Reward: Summon Felhunter and Box of Souls .",
