  "6-slot bag (Canvas Latchbag): Grund and Gozwin from Grund Drokda (Anvilmar). Level 6 quest. Pick it up as soon as you can.",
  "The Adventurer (Mountaineer Thalos, Coldridge Pass, lvl 6): prerequisite of The Great Outdoors.",
  "The Great Outdoors (Eric Brighthammer, Kharanos): pick it up as soon as you can (needs lvl 4). Then Camping 101: Cooking from the same NPC, for Basic Campfire.",
