  "Get the Flight Path: Thelsamar",
  "^spell_nature_ravenform^Trainer: Aspect of the Hawk, Track Humanoids, Tame Beast / Beast Training / Feed Pet / Revive Pet / Call Pet / Dismiss Pet",
  "Pet: Taming the Beast from Grif Wildheart (Kharanos): gives you a Taming Rod to tame 3 beasts in the zone, one after another (3 quests with the same name; the beast is written in the quest). Then Training the Beast: go to the Pet Trainer in the capital -> learn Tame Beast, Call Pet, Feed Pet, Revive Pet and Beast Training. After that, tame the Pet you want (below).",
  "^ability_hunter_mendpet^Trainer: Mend Pet, Wing Clip, Distracting Shot",
  "Hall of Thanes (lvl 13–18): Important Heirlooms (Thom Filch), The Restless Dead (Afadra Dunwall), Old Ironforge Incursion (Earthseer Farsen).",
  "^ability_druid_cower^Trainer: Scare Beast, Eyes of the Beast / Eagle Eye",
  "Poor Old Blanchy (Verna Furlbrow, The Jansen Stead): bag Old Blanchy's Feed Pouch (8 slots).",
  "Cozy Sleeping Bag: chain from Alexston Farmstead (Westfall), optional.",
  "Vyrin's Revenge (Vyrin Swiftwind, Farstrider Lodge): Hunting Satchel bag (10 slots). ; quest lvl 20.",
  "The Deadmines (lvl 17–26): first pick up The Defias Brotherhood from Gryan Stoutmantle in Sentinel Hill.",
  "Excavation Site: Wetlands: Alliance quests such as Songblade Search (Dorin Songblade, Lakeshire). (quest level 31).",
  "1Race: Dwarf",
  "0{Dwarf Hunter:} Big Game Hunter: +5% damage vs Beasts (many leveling mobs) ; Artisan’s Precision +1% Hit; Stoneform. Great, but no racial for the Pet.",
  "0{Stoneform}\nInstant, 3 min cooldown: removes and grants immunity to Bleed, Poison and Disease and reduces Physical damage taken by 10% for 8 sec. changed (Classic: +armor). client",
  "0{Find Treasure}\nTracking: shows treasures on the minimap and can increase chest loot; now stacks with other tracking. Lasts until you cancel it. client + WT",
  "0{Artisan's Precision}\nNew (passive): +1% Hit with all spells and attacks. client",
  "0{Big Game Hunter}\nNew (passive): +5% damage vs Beasts. client",
  "0Shaman is a new combination (), Dwarf only for the Alliance: there are totem quests (Warcraft Tavern: dwarf-shaman-totem-quests). Gun Specialization and Frost Resistance removed. Priest: Chastise and Desperate Prayer. Dun Morogh has no Flight Master: the first one is in Ironforge.",
  "0• {Human} (Alliance): New combination. Ruthless +1% crit (was 2%, halved on Oct 26), The Human Spirit +10% Spirit (doubled), Will to Survive (removes stuns), Perception. Method recommends it, but its numbers predate the patch.",
  "04 · {Canvas Latchbag} · 6 · Grund and Gozwin. Grund Drokda, Anvilmar (Method: /way Dun Morogh 28.6 67.4; the path starts at 25.5 70): reach the camp to the north-west, take the mechanic's log and kill the Snow Leopard Prowler. Method + leprestore.",
  "01 · {Ironforge} · Gryth Thurden /way 55.5 47.7 · First Flight Path (there are no Flight Masters in Dun Morogh). games.gg",
