  "03 · {Stormwind} · Dungar Longdrink /way 66.3 62.1 · After the tram: Dungar Longdrink.",
  "04 · {Sentinel Hill} · Thor /way 56 52 · When you arrive in Sentinel Hill on foot.",
  "05 · {Lakeshire} · Ariena Stormfeather /way 30.6 59.4 · As soon as you arrive in Lakeshire.",
