  "^spell_holy_resurrection^Trainer: Redemption",
  "Redemption: 1) Tome of Divinity from Azar Stronghammer (Kharanos) or Brandur Ironhammer (Ironforge). 2) The Tome of Divinity from Tiza Battleforge (Ironforge), then John Turner (Gates of Ironforge) and Muiredon Battleforge (Ironforge). 3) Go to Narm Faulk (Helm's Bed Lake, eastern Dun Morogh) and do The Symbol of Life: use the Symbol of Life on him -> learn Redemption.",
  "^spell_holy_sealofwisdom^Trainer: Blessing of Wisdom",
  "0{Dwarf Paladin:} Stoneform; Earth Fury +2% crit damage and healing ( replaces Mace Specialization, Leprestore). Conquest Capped also cites Artisan's Precision and Big Game Hunter . Starts from Coldridge Valley.",
  "0• {Human} (Alliance): Ruthless +2% crit on all spells and attacks ( replaces Sword Specialization, Oct 15), Will to Survive (removes stuns), Perception, The Human Spirit (+Spirit). Maxroll recommends it.",
