  "Chastise (20): Dwarf racial quest. Pick it up from High Priest Rohan (Ironforge), High Priestess Laurena (Stormwind) or Priestess Alathea (The Temple Gardens). Reward: Chastise (2 s root on humanoids).",
  "0{Dwarf Priest:} Alliance. Desperate Prayer (10, self-heal 146–181, 10 min CD), Chastise ( 20, 2 s root on humanoids); Stoneform / Artisan’s Precision (+1% hit, wowclassicforever.info). CC: “Average”.",
  "0• {Human} (Alliance): Alliance. The Human Spirit (+10% Spirit, upd. Oct 26) and Ruthless (+1% crit): great with Spirit Tap/Meditation. Racials: Divine Grace (10, heals ally <50% and removes Weakened Soul, NO self) and Feedback (20). DoubleZug: Human/Gnome are second-best for leveling; CC: “Weak” for leveling.",
