  "0{Dwarf Rogue:} Stoneform (10% physical damage, removes Bleed/Poison/Disease), Artisan's Precision +1% Hit, Big Game Hunter +5% vs Beast, Find Treasure (extra chests). More PvP than PvE according to Warcraft Tavern; tier C for speed (Rogue's Diary).",
  "0• {Human} (Alliance): Ruthless: +1% crit to everything (Warcraft Tavern says 2% — sources disagree; the tooltip decides), The Human Spirit +10% Spirit, Perception and Will to Survive mostly for PvP. Warcraft Tavern: best Alliance race in PvE. Mobalytics Rogue's Diary: tier B for leveling speed.",
