  "^spell_nature_earthshock^Trainer: Earth Shock, Stoneskin Totem",
  "Call of Earth (Dwarf): talk to Teo Hammerstorm in Anvilmar. Bring 2 Bear Pendant (Iceclaw or Frostmane, name ) from the Frostmane Troll Whelps (27.3 79.6). Find the Spirit Stone (25.0 62.4) and drink the Earth Sapta. Bring the Rough Quartz to Teo. Reward: Earth Totem.",
