  "^spell_fire_flameshock^Trainer: Flame Shock, Searing Totem, Flametongue Weapon, Strength of Earth Totem",
  "Call of Fire (Dwarf): start at Eldrun Stormbreaker (Ironforge) and look for Bruegs Kindleborn (Dun Morogh). Bruegs entrusts you with the Torch of the Dormant Flame to bring to Braldir Ashmantle (Loch Modan). Braldir asks for 1 Fire Tar (Silver Stream Mine) and 1 Reagent Pouch (Stonesplinter Seers, up to level 14). Light the Glowing Ember at the Minor Manifestation of Fire and put it in the brazier on the Fire Sapta (31.9 64.5). Bring the lit torch back to Bruegs. Reward: Fire Totem .",
