  "Call of Water (Dwarf): talk to Eldrun Stormbreaker (Ironforge), then to Norric Lochthane (Loch Modan). Norric sends you to Hervdana Saegrund (Wetlands). Fill 3 waterskins: red at Stonewatch Falls (near the Nightcrawler Murlocs), blue at Astranaar (Ashenvale), third . Bring the Vial of Purest Water to Norric. At Stendel's Pond (Westfall) drink the Water Sapta and cleanse the corruption with the Corrupt Manifestation's Bracers. Return to Norric and turn in the Shard of Water. Reward: Water Totem (Healing Stream Totem ).",
