  "0{Dwarf Warrior:} Stoneform (3 min, -10% physical damage for 8 s and cleanse of bleed/poison/disease), Artisan's Precision +1% Hit, Big Game Hunter +5% damage to Beasts (great in outdoor quests), Find Treasure. Mobalytics (snippet) recommends Dwarf for Alliance Warriors until 30 .",
  "0• {Human} (Alliance): Ruthless +1% crit to everything (Warcraft Tavern; in the Oct 16 notes it was +2%), Will to Survive removes every stun, Perception, The Human Spirit +10% Spirit (little for Warrior). No more Sword/Mace Specialization.",
  "^spell_frost_frostarmor02^Trainer: Frost Armor, Arcane Intellect, Fireball",
  "Class letter: Sten Stoutarm, Anvilmar.",
  "^spell_frost_frostbolt02^Trainer: Frostbolt, Conjure Water",
  "^spell_fire_fireball^Trainer: Fire Blast, Conjure Food",
