  "Moonglade (level 10): the quest unlocks Teleport: Moonglade. Pick it up from Mathrengyl Bearwalker (Night Elf) or Turak Runetotem (Tauren). Use the teleport and talk to Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven. Needed for Lessons Anew, A Lesson to Learn and Cat Spirit.",
