  "Ferocity:Feral Combat;Ferocity:Feral Combat;Ferocity:Feral Combat;Furor:Feral Combat;Furor:Feral Combat;Furor:Feral Combat;Furor:Feral Combat;Furor:Feral Combat;Feral Swiftness:Feral Combat;Feral Swiftness:Feral Combat;Sharpened Claws:Feral Combat;Sharpened Claws:Feral Combat;Savage Fury:Feral Combat;Savage Fury:Feral Combat;Feral Charge:Feral Combat;Predatory Discipline:Feral Combat;Blood Frenzy:Feral Combat;Blood Frenzy:Feral Combat;Predatory Strikes:Feral Combat;Predatory Strikes:Feral Combat;Leader of the Pack:Feral Combat;Natural Instinct:Feral Combat;Natural Instinct:Feral Combat;Predatory Strikes:Feral Combat;Ferocity:Feral Combat;Rend and Tear:Feral Combat;Rend and Tear:Feral Combat;Rend and Tear:Feral Combat;Rend and Tear:Feral Combat;Rend and Tear:Feral Combat;Shifting Power:Feral Combat;Genesis:Balance;Genesis:Balance;Genesis:Balance;Genesis:Balance;Genesis:Balance;Nature's Majesty:Balance;Nature's Majesty:Balance;Nature's Reach:Balance;Nature's Reach:Balance;Heart of the Wild:Restoration;Heart of the Wild:Restoration;Heart of the Wild:Restoration;Heart of the Wild:Restoration;Heart of the Wild:Restoration;Naturalist:Restoration;Naturalist:Restoration;Naturalist:Restoration;Naturalist:Restoration;Naturalist:Restoration;Natural Shapeshifter:Restoration",
  "1Talents: Feral 1–60",
  "0{Choice:} Feral (Cat from 20, Bear when needed) is the most recommended solo leveling spec: Warcraft Tavern (Luxrah) 'Feral cats will have the smoothest route', Method (BirraGzeez) 'the fastest and most popular choice', mmonster (Nov 5 tier list) and Mobalytics. Since Nov 6 build A is Mobalytics {yumytv}'s (87 , Druid 1–60 guide updated after launch): Ferocity, Furor 5 (Energy and Rage when you shift), Feral Swiftness, Sharpened Claws and Savage Fury, Feral Charge at 24, Leader of the Pack at 30, Shifting Power at 40; then Balance (Genesis, Nature's Majesty) and Restoration (Heart of the Wild, Naturalist), 9/31/11 at 60. wowforever.be (client data) goes 0/34/17.",
  "0{Ferocity} 3/5 · lvl 10–12",
  "0{Furor} 5/5 · lvl 13–17",
  "0{Feral Swiftness} 2/2 · lvl 18–19",
  "0{Sharpened Claws} 2/2 · lvl 20–21",
