  "The Great Ursera Spirit (Skyborne, level 10): talk to Lotheluum Starbreeze, then to Urs'endris near the waterfalls north-east of Valanaar. Reward: Bear Form .",
  "^spell_nature_resistnature^Trainer: Regrowth, Revive, Enrage",
