  "Lessons Anew (Cure Poison) from Alfina Nightgaze (Dalaran): use Teleport: Moonglade and follow the chain with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven -> learn Cure Poison.",
  "A Lesson to Learn (Aquatic Form): after Lessons Anew, ask the Druid Trainer who gave it to you (Alfina Nightgaze in Dalaran or Hana Lighthoof in Thunder Bluff); the chain goes from Dendrite Starblaze to Moonglade -> Aquatic Form.",
  "The Great Windborne Cat Spirit (Skyborne, level 20, Cat Form): talk to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Look for the Avatar of Saeyleenan in the south of Moonglade. Retrieve the three relics at Stormrage Barrow Den and bring them to the Avatar. Reward: Cat Form .",
