  "1Race: Skyborne (High Order)",
  "0{Skyborne (High Order) Druid:} High Order (Alliance). Walk on Air (slow fall, CD 90 s), Wind Blessed (+1–2% haste conflicting numbers), Elemental Insight (+5% damage vs Elemental), Read Ley Line (+50%/100% HP and Mana regen for 15 s, CD 2 min, doesn't stack with Innervate: reduces downtime between pulls). You start at Zephras Isle (3–12).",
  "0{Walk on Air}\nNew, instant, 1.5 min cooldown: glide downward for 10 sec while steering. client",
  "0{Read Leyline}\nNew (High Order only): 0.5 sec cast, 2 min cooldown, +50% Health and Mana regeneration for 15 sec. Near a Ley Line you become Attuned for 1 hour and the effect rises by 100%. Does not stack with Innervate. client + WT",
  "0{Wind Blessed}\nNew (passive): Haste +2% (spell, melee, ranged). client",
  "0{Elemental Insight}\nNew (passive): +5% damage vs Elementals. client",
  "0Requires a purchase bundle (Skyborne Heroic/Epic Pack). They start in Thendal Village and leave Zephras Isle at ~12-14. High Order reputation: 5% discount at Friendly up to 20% at Exalted on mounts and Riding (Galestrider, Fairweather Stables 53.8 81.3). Darnassian shared with Night Elves; only Skyborne with Mage (the Windshapers have Shaman). The race icon is the Blood Elf one (similar model): no Skyborne icon found.",
  "0• {Night Elf} (Alliance): Alliance. Elune's Light (+10% crit for 15 s, burst), Shadowmeld, Quickness (+1% Dodge, +2% speed), Wisp Spirit. games.gg: 'the best for parses, close to Tauren'; Method: the Alliance's all-around choice. Druid quests in Darnassus.",
