  "1Race: Orc",
  "0{Orc Hunter:} Command: Pets deal +5% damage (back on Oct 26, for BM); Blood Fury +10% AP for 15 s with 2 min cooldown; Hardiness (stun 20%); Shatter Curse. According to Method the best Horde race, but Savage has been removed.",
  "0{Blood Fury}\nActive (2 min cooldown): +10% Attack Power and Spell Power for 15 s. Now also Spell Power and no penalty to healing received; the 3 min cooldown from Oct 15 returned to 2 min on Oct 27. (patch notes Oct 15/26/27, Warcraft Tavern, Kami-Labs)",
  "0{Shatter Curse}\nActive new: instantly removes all Curses and Bane and reduces magic damage taken by 5% for 8 s (was immunity and 15% in beta). Cooldown not confirmed. (Wowhead Forever + Oct 15 notes; the “3 min” cooldown is only from LFCarry )",
  "0{Hardiness}\nPassive: stun duration on you is reduced by 20%. Previously it was a 25-35% chance to resist.",
  "0{Command}\nPassive: +5% Pet damage for Hunter and Warlock. Removed in beta, restored Oct 26 (replacing Savage +1% crit). Axe Specialization was removed. (Warcraft Tavern Oct 26, Kami-Labs)",
  "0Mage Orc is a new combination: Blood Fury gives Spell Power. For Hunter and Warlock, Command only counts with the Pet out. Start in the Valley of Trials (The Den) and don't stray from Razor Hill before 10.",
