  "Before you leave:Hearthstone at Orgrimmar (or Undercity) before boarding the zeppelin.; Ragefire Chasm: quests from Varimathras (Undercity) and from Thrall and Neeru Fireblade (Orgrimmar) , complete them first if you want to finish it.; Camping and Basic Campfire (Cooking) already done on the Horde Kalimdor route (lvl 5–6).; First talent point (lvl 10) assigned before leaving the Barrens.; Quest:The Power to Destroy… (Ragefire Chasm) – Varimathras, Undercity (lvl 13): Dungeon quest (tirisfal questNPCs).; Light's Justice, The New Plague, The Wrath of Rath'mael (and others) – not found, Ruins of Lordaeron, entrance outside Undercity (lvl 15–20): Dungeon chain Warcraft Tavern; NPCs not listed.; Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills (493) – Deathstalker Lesh, Silverpine (20.8 47.4) (lvl 19): Leads to Tarren Mill (Tirisfal route milestone 19) .; Cozy Sleeping Bag (Horde chain, optional) – item: Burned-Out Remains, The Barrens (46 74) (lvl 14): Barrens -> Westfall -> Stonetalon -> Loch Modan -> Hillsbrad. Warcraft Tavern: lvl 14 minimum. Method: hard Horde version, recommended ~30 .",
