  "0drop · {Small Blue Pouch} · 6 · Drop from Stephen Bhartec near Deathknell (beta).",
  "09 · {The Sepulcher (Silverpine Forest)} · Karos Razok /way 45.6 42.4 · As soon as you enter Silverpine (10–11). Hearth recommended here. (wmd + games.gg Sep 19)",
  "010 · {Undercity} · Michael Garrett /way in town · First trip to Undercity (13–15). Connects The Sepulcher and Tarren Mill.",
  "011 · {Tarren Mill (Hillsbrad Foothills)} · Zarise /way 60.2 18.6 · Arrive in Hillsbrad (19–20). (wmd + games.gg Sep 22)",
  "012 · {Hammerfall (Arathi Highlands)} · Urda /way unverified · Only after 30 (Arathi). Master: Urda, wmd.",
  "2From Orgrimmar to Silverpine and Hillsbrad via the Undercity zeppelin",
  "0Ideal at lvl 14–15: leave the Barrens after the Crossroads (10–14), without passing through Ratchet and Camp Taurajo. Go from Orgrimmar to Undercity by zeppelin and follow the Undead route. Reason: Silverpine (10–20) and Hillsbrad (19–25) are on the Tirisfal route, and Undercity is the natural entry point. Skyborne Windshaper: from Zephras Isle at 12 with the Skycutter to Thunder Bluff, then Orgrimmar and the zeppelin.",
  "0• Hearthstone at Orgrimmar (or Undercity) before boarding the zeppelin.",
  "0• Ragefire Chasm: quests from Varimathras (Undercity) and from Thrall and Neeru Fireblade (Orgrimmar) , complete them first if you want to finish it.",
  "0• Camping and Basic Campfire (Cooking) already done on the Horde Kalimdor route (lvl 5–6).",
  "0• First talent point (lvl 10) assigned before leaving the Barrens.",
  "0{Pros:} Direct, fast zeppelin. Silverpine and Hillsbrad (19–31) have FPs at The Sepulcher (Karos Razok), Undercity (Michael Garrett) and Tarren Mill (Zarise 60.2 18.6) . Scarlet Monastery (26–45) and Arathi stay on the route.\n{Cons:} You miss Ashenvale, Stonetalon and Thousand Needles (22–30) from the Orc/Troll/Tauren route. Southshore is hostile for Horde. Returning to the Barrens requires the zeppelin.",
  "0• Zeppelin Undercity (tower outside Brill, Tirisfal Glades ~61 59) Orgrimmar and Grom'gol Base Camp (wmd voyages): only needed to go to the Barrens.",
  "0• Southshore boat: hostile for Horde.",
