  "^ability_rogue_rupture^Trainer: Rupture, Poisons (quest)",
  "Poison quest (Horde): 1) The Shattered Salute (20) from Shenthul (Orgrimmar), perform the indicated salute. 2) Deep Cover (20) from Shenthul, in the north-east of The Barrens (Sludge Fen). 3) Mission: Possible But Not Probable (24, Taskmaster Fizzule, Sludge Fen): use the rocket pistol on the Venture Co. Tower, kill 2 Mutated Drones, 2 Lookouts and 2 Patrollers, steal Silixiz's key from Foreman Silixiz, kill Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix (elite 23) and open his chest with Lockpicking 70. 4) Hinott's Assistance (20, Serge Hinott, Tarren Mill): removes the 7-day debuff and unlocks poison crafting. Horde is much harder.",
  "^ability_rogue_distract^Trainer: Distract, Vanish",
  "^spell_nature_nullifydisease^Trainer: Mind-numbing Poison, Shank",
