  "^spell_magic_featherfall^Trainer: Safe Fall",
  "0{Orc Rogue:} Blood Fury (+10% Attack Power for 15 s, 3 min) is the best burst; Hardiness (20% stun duration), Shatter Curse. Warcraft Tavern: the best Horde race in PvE; Method recommends it; Rogue's Diary tier B for pure leveling (low mobility/healing).",
