  "^spell_nature_earthshock^Trainer: Earth Shock, Stoneskin Totem",
  "Call of Earth (Orc/Troll): talk to Canaga Earthcaller in the Valley of Trials. Bring 2 Felstalker Hoof. Find a Spirit Rock and drink the Earth Sapta. Bring the Rough Quartz to Canaga. Reward: Earth Totem.",
  "^spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02^Trainer: Earthbind Totem",
  "^spell_nature_stoneclawtotem^Trainer: Stoneclaw Totem, Lightning Shield",
  "^spell_fire_flameshock^Trainer: Flame Shock, Searing Totem, Flametongue Weapon, Strength of Earth Totem",
  "Call of Fire (Orc/Troll): talk to Searn Firewarder (Orgrimmar) or Swart (Razor Hill). Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens (Grol'dom Farm) and get the Torch of the Dormant Flame from him. Bring it to Telf Joolam (Shrine of the Dormant Flame, Durotar) with 1 Fire Tar and 1 Reagent Pouch. Then light the Glowing Ember on the Minor Manifestation of Fire and put it in the brazier on the Shrine of Eternal Flame. Reward: Fire Totem .",
  "^spell_fire_sealoffire^Trainer: Fire Nova, Purge, Ancestral Spirit",
  "^spell_nature_nullifypoison^Trainer: Cure Poison",
  "^spell_nature_tremortotem^Trainer: Tremor Totem",
  "^spell_nature_spiritwolf^Trainer: Ghost Wolf, Frost Shock, Frostbrand Weapon, Healing Stream Totem, Lesser Healing Wave, Call of the Elements, Totemic Recall",
  "Call of Water (Orc/Troll): talk to Searn Firewarder (Orgrimmar) or Swart (Razor Hill). Find Islen Waterseer in the Barrens. Islen sends you to Brine (Southern Barrens). Fill 3 waterskins: red at the Tarren Mill well, brown at the pool under Brine's hut, blue at the Ruins of Stardust (Ashenvale). Bring the Vial of Purest Water to Islen. At Silverpine Forest (Everfount brazier) destroy the Corrupt Manifestation of Water and apply its Bracers. Turn in the Shard of Water to Islen. Reward: Water Totem .",
