  "^spell_nature_magicimmunity^Trainer: Dual Talent Specialization, Chain Heal, Stormstrike (Rank 2)",
  "0{Orc Shaman:} Blood Fury +10% AP and Spell Power for 15 s, 2 min cooldown (reduced Oct 27): the best burst for Enhancement. Shatter Curse, Hardiness 20% stun duration, Command useless. Axe Specialization and Savage removed Oct 26. Rankedboost (snippet): top race for Shaman.",
  "0• {Dwarf} (Alliance): The only Alliance race. Stoneform (10% Physical for 8 s + removes Bleed/Poison/Disease), Artisan's Precision +1% Hit, Big Game Hunter +5% damage to Beasts, Find Treasure. Weapon spec removed. Trainers: Teo Hammerstorm (Anvilmar), Ingrid Dunwald (Kharanos), Eldrun Stormbreaker (Ironforge) client.",
