  "Vile Familiars (Orc/Troll, level 4): talk to Ruzan or Zureetha Fargaze (The Den). Kill 12 Vile Familiars and bring them back to Zureetha Fargaze outside the Den. Bring 6 Vile Familiar Heads to Ruzan. Reward: Summon Imp .",
  "^spell_shadow_burningspirit^Trainer: Life Tap",
  "^spell_shadow_curseofsargeras^Trainer: Bane of Agony, Fear",
  "^spell_shadow_haunting^Trainer: Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, Summon Voidwalker",
  "Gan'rul's Summons (Orc/Troll, level 10): talk to Ophek in Razor Hill, then to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar. Then Creature of the Void: recover the Tablet of Verga for Gan'rul (Skull Rock ). Then The Binding: use the Glyphs of Summoning to summon and subjugate a Voidwalker, bring the glyphs back to Gan'rul. Reward: Summon Voidwalker .",
  "^spell_shadow_lifedrain^Trainer: Health Funnel",
  "^spell_shadow_lifedrain02^Trainer: Drain Life, Curse of Recklessness",
