  "^ability_racial_bloodrage^Trainer: Bloodrage, Sunder Armor, Defensive Stance",
  "Defensive Stance: 1) Path of Defense from Uzzek (Far Watch Post, Barrens entrance from Durotar). 2) Thun'grim Firegaze: go to Thun'grim (Thorn Hill, north-east Barrens). 3) Forged Steel from Thun'grim -> learn Defensive Stance (Taunt, Sunder Armor). Tauren and Undead: worth doing when you reach the Barrens.",
