  "^ability_warrior_decisivestrike^Trainer: Slam, Cleave, Victory Rush, Retaliation, Dual Wield",
  "Speak with Thun'grim (Camp Taurajo, from Ruga Ragetotem): sends you to Thun'grim Firegaze, who at 30 gives the Brutal Hauberk/Brutal Armor armor quests.",
