  "^ability_criticalstrike^Trainer: Recklessness",
  "0{Orc Warrior:} Blood Fury +10% Attack Power/Spell Power for 15 s (tooltip: 2 min CD; Oct 16 notes: 3 min ), Hardiness -20% stun duration, Shatter Curse, Command (useless). Savage removed.",
