  "1Race: Troll",
  "0{Troll Hunter:} Beast Slaying +5% damage to Beasts (great for leveling) ; Berserking +10% haste for 10 s; Regeneration; Rapid Regeneration (channel, 50% Health). With the Orc, it's the most sensible choice for a Horde Hunter.",
  "0{Berserking}\nActive (3 min cooldown): +10% Attack Speed and Spell Haste for 15 s. Now fixed at 10%, no longer up to 30% at low health; duration raised to 15 s on Oct 27 (was 10).",
  "0{Regeneration}\nPassive: +20% Health regeneration, and the 20% continues in combat. Was 10% in beta, 20% from Oct 15.",
  "0{Rapid Regeneration}\nActive new: restores 50% of max Health over 6 s (channel: any movement, action or damage cancels it). Cooldown not found. (Wowhead Forever; Warcraft Tavern)",
  "0{Beast Slaying}\nPassive: +5% damage vs Beasts. Very useful in the Barrens (raptor, plainstrider, hyena).",
  "0Troll Warlock is new. Rapid Regeneration counts as free “food” between pulls. If you're a Hunter, Beast Slaying adds to the Pet and works on almost all Barrens creatures. Troll Priest: Hex of Weakness and Shadowguard.",
  "0{Troll Mage:} Berserking for burst; faster Health regeneration.",
