  "Hex of Weakness (10): Troll racial quest. Pick it up from Tai'jin (Razor Hill), Var'jun (Bloodhoof Village), Aelthalyste (Undercity) or Ur'kyo (Rocktusk Farm). Reward: Hex of Weakness.",
