  "^spell_holy_prayerofspirit^Trainer: Prayer of Spirit",
  "0{Troll Priest:} Horde. Hex of Weakness (10, 43 AP, 20% healing received) and Shadowguard (20, 3 charges 10 min), Berserking (+10% cast speed 15 s), Beast Slaying (“gains a lot of value while leveling”, DoubleZug), Rapid Regeneration. CC: “Best”.",
  "^spell_shadow_psychicscream^Trainer: Psychic Scream, Cure Disease",
  "^spell_holy_heal^Trainer: Heal",
  "^spell_holy_dispelmagic^Trainer: Dispel Magic",
