  "^spell_holy_mindvision^Trainer: Mind Vision",
  "^spell_shadow_manaburn^Trainer: Mana Burn",
  "^spell_holy_blindingheal^Trainer: Binding Heal",
  "^spell_holy_divinespirit^Trainer: Divine Spirit, Mind Control, Prayer of Healing, Shadow Protection, Penance",
  "^spell_shadow_demonicfortitude^Trainer: Shadow Word: Death, Abolish Disease",
  "0{Troll Rogue:} Berserking (+10% haste), Rapid Regeneration (50% HP in 6 s, no corpse needed), Regeneration (20% regen in combat), Beast Slaying (+5% vs Beast). Warcraft Tavern: second in Horde PvE; Rogue's Diary: 'less downtime than almost everyone'.",
  "0{Troll Shaman:} Berserking +10% cast and attack speed for 15 s (increased Oct 27), Rapid Regeneration (50% Health over time), Beast Slaying +5% to Beasts, Regeneration 10% in combat. Rankedboost (snippet): A.",
  "Gan'rul's Summons (Orc/Troll, level 10): talk to Ophek in Razor Hill, then to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar. Then Creature of the Void: recover the Tablet of Verga for Gan'rul (Skull Rock ). Then The Binding: use the Glyphs of Summoning to summon and subjugate a Voidwalker, bring the glyphs back to Gan'rul. Reward: Summon Voidwalker .",
  "0{Troll Warlock:} Troll (Horde, new Warlock ): Berserking (+10% haste, doesn't apply to DoTs), Rapid Regeneration (channel that heals, great with Life Tap), Regeneration (HP regen in combat), Beast Slaying (+5% damage to Beasts, useful in the Barrens). Method: tier C. Starts in the Valley of Trials like the Orc.",
  "0{Troll Warrior:} Berserking +10% attack/cast speed for 15 s (3 min CD; nerf from Classic's 30%), Beast Slaying +5% damage to Beasts, Regeneration (20% from Oct 16 ), Rapid Regeneration (channeled).",
  "1. Camp Narache",
  "2. Bloodhoof Village",
