  "Class trainer Tauren: Gart Mistrunner (Red Cloud Mesa, Mulgore) or Gennia Runetotem (Bloodhoof Village).",
  "^spell_nature_starfall^Trainer: Moonfire, Rejuvenation",
  "6-slot bag (Grace of An'she and Mu'sha): Seer Graytongue, Red Cloud Mesa. Bring the incense to the shrine before the timer runs out.",
  "The Adventurer (Chief Hawkwind, Camp Narache, lvl 6), then The Great Outdoors (Kaga Wildhoof, Bloodhoof Village): unlocks Camping.",
  "^spell_nature_thorns^Trainer: Thorns",
  "Camping 101: Cooking from Kaga Wildhoof: unlocks Basic Campfire.",
