  "Heeding the Call (Tauren, level 10): talk to Gennia Runetotem in Bloodhoof Village. Then talk to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff. Reward: Bear Form.",
  "^spell_nature_resistnature^Trainer: Regrowth, Revive, Enrage",
