  "Cozy Sleeping Bag: long, optional chain.",
  "Lessons Anew (Tauren, level 14, Cure Poison): talk to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise. Use Teleport: Moonglade and talk to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Reward: Cure Poison .",
  "^ability_druid_aquaticform^Trainer: Aquatic Form, Swipe",
  "A Lesson to Learn (Tauren, level 16, Aquatic Form): talk to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise. Use Teleport: Moonglade and talk to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Reward: Aquatic Form (Idol of Shifting Tides ).",
  "^spell_nature_faeriefire^Trainer: Faerie Fire, Hibernate",
  "^ability_druid_catform^Trainer: Cat Form, Claw, Prowl, Rip, Shred, Starfire, Rebirth, Omen of Clarity, Polearms",
  "The Great Cat Spirit (Tauren, level 20, Cat Form): talk to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise. Use Teleport: Moonglade and talk to Dendrite Starblaze. Go to the south of Moonglade to the Great Cat Spirit. Retrieve the three relics at Stormrage Barrow Den and bring them back to the spirit. Reward: Cat Form .",
  "^ability_hunter_beastsoothe^Trainer: Soothe Animal",
  "^spell_nature_removecurse^Trainer: Remove Curse, Rake, Tiger's Fury",
  "^ability_druid_dash^Trainer: Dash, Abolish Poison",
  "^ability_druid_cower^Trainer: Cower, Challenging Roar",
  "^ability_druid_supriseattack^Trainer: Pounce, Frenzied Regeneration",
  "^ability_racial_bearform^Trainer: Dire Bear Form, Innervate, Hurricane, Feline Grace, Dual Talent Specialization",
  "^spell_nature_stoneclawtotem^Trainer: Barkskin",
  "1Race: Tauren",
  "0{Tauren Druid:} Horde. War Stomp (stun 2 s on 5 enemies, CD 90 s, usable in form ), Cultivation (duplicates an herb, CD 15 min), Plainsrunning (+1% speed every 5 s up to +30%, +3% mounted), Endurance (+5% HP and +1% Hit). games.gg: 'the strongest' for Druids; Method: ideal for Bear tank and PvP. Quests in Thunder Bluff.",
  "0{War Stomp}\nActive: 0.5 s cast, stuns up to 5 enemies within 8 yd for 2 s. 90 s cooldown (was 2 min); Druids can use it in form.",
  "0{Cultivation}\nActive changed: duplicates a nearby herb (15 min cooldown, 3 s cast, each herb only once), without needing Herbalism to gather it.",
  "0{Plainsrunning}\nPassive new: +2% speed every 5 s of running, up to +60% after 2 min 30 (was +1%/30% until Oct 26). You lose 1 stack standing still for 1 s and 6 if you get hit. Doesn't work while mounted (the +3% mounted was removed Oct 26). Doesn't stack with other speed buffs.",
  "0{Endurance}\nPassive: +5% total Health. The crit-damage bonus from Oct 15 was removed.",
  "0Plainsrunning makes the Barrens very smooth: look for long routes without stopping. It's the only Horde race without a new class . Thunder Bluff is nearby (Tal) and the 12-slot bag quest from Skywatcher Plateau at 23.",
  "0~4–7 · {Scorched Leather Pouch} · 6 · Quest Grace of An'she and Mu'sha: Red Cloud Mesa (Mulgore). Bring the lit incense to the shrine before the quest expires. (LepreStore, Oct 16; NPC and coordinates not found)",
  "01 · {Thunder Bluff (Mulgore)} · Tal /way in town (Thunder Bluff) · For Tauren on the first pass through town (around 8-10); for others only if you go to Mulgore (Skywatcher Plateau 23+, RFC and WC quests from Rahauro and Nara Wildmane). Connects Crossroads, Camp Taurajo, Sun Rock Retreat, Freewind Post and Orgrimmar.",
  "^spell_nature_nullifypoison^Trainer: Cure Poison, Bash",
  "^ability_druid_aquaticform^Trainer: Aquatic Form, Swipe",
  "^spell_nature_faeriefire^Trainer: Faerie Fire, Hibernate",
  "^ability_druid_catform^Trainer: Cat Form, Claw, Prowl, Rip, Shred, Starfire, Rebirth, Omen of Clarity, Polearms",
  "^ability_hunter_beastsoothe^Trainer: Soothe Animal",
  "^spell_nature_removecurse^Trainer: Remove Curse, Rake, Tiger's Fury",
  "^ability_druid_dash^Trainer: Dash, Abolish Poison",
