  "^ability_meleedamage^Trainer: Raptor Strike, Auto Shot, Track Beasts",
  "^ability_hunter_quickshot^Trainer: Serpent Sting, Aspect of the Monkey",
  "^ability_impalingbolt^Trainer: Arcane Shot, Hunter's Mark",
  "^spell_frost_stun^Trainer: Concussive Shot",
  "Pet: Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane (Bloodhoof Village): gives you a Taming Rod to tame 3 beasts in the zone, one after another (3 quests with the same name; the beast is written in the quest). Then Training the Beast: go to the Pet Trainer in the capital -> learn Tame Beast, Call Pet, Feed Pet, Revive Pet and Beast Training. After that, tame the Pet you want (below).",
  "0{Tauren Hunter:} War Stomp (2 s stun to escape), Endurance (5% Health), Plainsrunning (+2% speed every 5 s, max 60%), Cultivation (duplicates herbs). No offensive bonus.",
  "^spell_nature_lightning^Trainer: Lightning Bolt, Rockbiter Weapon, Healing Wave",
  "^spell_nature_earthshock^Trainer: Earth Shock, Stoneskin Totem",
  "Call of Earth (Tauren): talk to Seer Ravenfeather at Camp Narache (Mulgore). Bring 2 Ritual Salve. Find the Kodo Rock and drink the Earth Sapta. Bring the Rough Quartz to Ravenfeather. Reward: Earth Totem.",
  "^spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02^Trainer: Earthbind Totem",
  "^spell_nature_stoneclawtotem^Trainer: Stoneclaw Totem, Lightning Shield",
  "Call of Fire (Tauren): talk to Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff) or Narm Skychaser (Bloodhoof Village). Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens and follow the same Orc/Troll chain (torch, Telf Joolam, Fire Tar and Reagent Pouch, Glowing Ember). Reward: Fire Totem .",
  "Call of Water (Tauren): talk to Narm Skychaser (Bloodhoof Village) or Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise). Follow the same Horde chain: Islen Waterseer in the Barrens, Brine, 3 waterskins, Vial of Purest Water, Silverpine Forest, Shard of Water to Islen. Reward: Water Totem .",
  "Call of Air (Tauren): talk to Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff). Find Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles, as for Orc/Troll Reward: Air Totem .",
  "0{Tauren Shaman:} War Stomp (stuns multiple enemies, 2 s), Plainsrunning up to +60% speed (2% per stack, not while mounted), Endurance +5% Health (hit and crit removed Oct 26), Cultivation. New trainer: Palah Thunderhoof (Camp Gev'rek).",
  "^ability_warrior_battleshout^Trainer: Battle Shout, Heroic Strike",
  "^ability_gouge^Trainer: Rend, Charge",
  "^spell_nature_thunderclap^Trainer: Thunder Clap",
  "^ability_shockwave^Trainer: Hamstring",
  "0{Tauren Warrior:} Endurance +5% Health (useful for tanks), War Stomp (0,5 s cast, 2 s stun on 5 enemies at 8 yd, 90 s CD), Plainsrunning up to +30% speed after 150 s of running and +3% mount, Cultivation (herbalism).",
