  "6-slot bag (Sticks and Bones): Deathguard Bartholomew, Brill. Collect 6 Dry Branches.",
  "The Great Outdoors (Eleanor Shackleton, Brill, lvl 6): unlocks Camping. Then Camping 101: Cooking from the same NPC, for Basic Campfire.",
