  "Apothecary Faranell (Undercity): A Recipe For Death (lvl 15). Undercity Flight Path (Michael Garrett).",
  "^spell_nature_wispsplode^Trainer: Arcane Explosion",
  "Ruins of Lordaeron (lvl 15–20): Light's Justice (Morbin Lightbane) and The Wrath of Rath'mael (Deathguard Kristof). (lvl 21–22 quests, available from 15)",
  "^spell_fire_selfdestruct^Trainer: Flamestrike",
  "Pyrewood Ambush (Deathstalker Faerleia, Pyrewood Village, lvl 15). The Book of Ur (Keeper Bel'dugur, Undercity) (lvl 26 quest).",
  "Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills (Apothecary Renferrel, The Sepulcher, lvl 20): leads to the Hillsbrad zone.",
  "1Race: Undead",
  "0{Undead Mage:} Will of the Forsaken against Fear/Charm; Cannibalize reduces downtime.",
  "0{Will of the Forsaken}\nActive (2 min cooldown): instantly removes Charm, Fear and Sleep. No longer grants immunity; can't be used under Scatter Shot.",
  "0{Cannibalize}\nActive (2 min cooldown): on a Humanoid or Undead corpse within 5 yd, regenerates 7% of Health and Mana every 2 s for 10 s. Now also Mana.",
  "0{Underwater Breathing}\nPassive: underwater breath +300%.",
  "0{Touch of the Grave}\nPassive new: your spells and attacks have a 20% (Paladin, Rogue, Warrior) or 30% (casters) chance to drain Health up to 5% of your max Health; internal cooldown 15 s (was 25 s until Oct 27). (Kami-Labs Oct 27 + Wowhead Forever)",
  "0Undead Paladin is the faction's new combination. You don't have to cross the world: Tirisfal -> Silverpine -> Hillsbrad covers 1–30 and includes Ruins of Lordaeron (15–20). Priest: Touch of Weakness and Dark Sacrifice (Warcraft Tavern, races page).",
  "01 · {The Sepulcher (Silverpine Forest)} · Karos Razok /way 45.6 42.4 · As soon as you enter Silverpine (10–11). Hearth recommended here. (wmd + games.gg Sep 19)",
  "02 · {Undercity} · Michael Garrett /way in town · First trip to Undercity (13–15). Connects The Sepulcher and Tarren Mill.",
  "03 · {Tarren Mill (Hillsbrad Foothills)} · Zarise /way 60.2 18.6 · Arrive in Hillsbrad (19–20). (wmd + games.gg Sep 22)",
