  "^ability_thunderbolt^Trainer: Seal of Righteousness, Holy Light, Devotion Aura",
  "A Difficult Path (1) then Rediscovering the Light (2) and Coming to Terms / Continue Your Training (4): Deathknell chain. Start with Shadow Priest Sarvis, then Aramis Hammerhand.",
  "^spell_holy_fistofjustice^Trainer: Blessing of Might, Judgement",
  "^classicon_paladin^Trainer: Holy Strike, Divine Protection, Seal of the Crusader",
  "^spell_holy_sealofmight^Trainer: Hammer of Justice, Purify",
  "^spell_holy_layonhands^Trainer: Lay on Hands, Blessing of Protection, Righteous Fury, Seal of Fury",
  "A Second Home (11): Undead quest in Brill, from Shari Stilwell. Unlocks the class part of your Horde city.",
  "^spell_holy_resurrection^Trainer: Redemption",
  "Redemption: A Lesson in Divinity from Danitha Morr or Deathguard Billmuth (Bandarion Keep, Tirisfal), Deathguard Falgan (Venomweb Vale) or Tanis Alderwood (Ruins of Lordaeron): follow the chain to Redemption.",
  "^spell_holy_sealofwisdom^Trainer: Blessing of Wisdom",
  "^spell_holy_auraoflight^Trainer: Retribution Aura",
  "^spell_holy_sealofvalor^Trainer: Blessing of Freedom",
  "^spell_magic_magearmor^Trainer: Blessing of Kings, Consecration, Exorcism, Flash of Light",
  "^spell_holy_mindsooth^Trainer: Concentration Aura, Seal of Justice",
  "A Curious Pair (22, Trevan Rol, The Sepulcher), A Grim Fate (22, Deathguard Baldren, The Sepulcher), Diplomatic Incident (22, Danitha Morr, Bandarion Keep): Undead class quests to do from 22.",
  "^spell_holy_turnundead^Trainer: Turn Undead",
  "Undead weapon chain: The Moonsilver Blade (25, Ott in Tarren Mill), A Moon-Kissed Blade (25, Lumina Windsinger, The Sepulcher), then Old Fire-Eye (26, Lumina Windsinger, The Sepulcher). Alternative from 22: The Wrath of Rath'mael (Ruins of Lordaeron, Deathguard Kristof in Brill).",
  "^spell_holy_sealofsalvation^Trainer: Salvation, Revoke",
  "^spell_shadow_sealofkings^Trainer: Shadow Resistance Aura",
  "^spell_nature_timestop^Trainer: Divine Intervention, Seal of Light",
  "^spell_frost_wizardmark^Trainer: Frost Resistance Aura",
  "^spell_holy_divineintervention^Trainer: Divine Shield",
  "^spell_fire_sealoffire^Trainer: Fire Resistance Aura",
  "^spell_holy_righteousnessaura^Trainer: Seal of Wisdom",
  "^ability_paladin_hammeroftherighteous^Trainer: Hammer of the Righteous, Blessing of Light",
  "Summon Warhorse: The Tome of Nobility (Duthorian Rall, Stormwind; steps with Arthur the Faithful and Brandur Ironhammer). Apprentice Riding, Dual Talent Specialization. Hammer of the Righteous , Unsealed Wrath . Plate Armor.",
  "^spell_holy_renew^Trainer: Cleanse",
  "^ability_thunderclap^Trainer: Hammer of Wrath",
  "^spell_holy_sealofsacrifice^Trainer: Blessing of Sacrifice",
  "^spell_holy_excorcism^Trainer: Holy Wrath",
  "^spell_holy_greaterblessingofkings^Trainer: Greater Blessing of Might",
  "Western Plaguelands: Chillwind Point, Dispelling Evil, Forging the Mightstone (Alliance class quest).",
  "^spell_holy_greaterblessingofwisdom^Trainer: Greater Blessing of Wisdom",
  "^spell_magic_greaterblessingofkings^Trainer: Greater Blessing of Kings, Mass Salvation, Greater Blessing of Light",
  "0{Undead Paladin:} First time Horde Paladins. Will of the Forsaken (removes Charm/Fear/Sleep, with no immunity afterwards), Cannibalize (restores health and mana), Touch of the Grave (20% drain, 25 s cooldown from Oct 15). Conquest Capped and Maxroll list it as the best for leveling. Starts from Deathknell/Brill; trainers Aramis Hammerhand, Shari Stilwell, Hilda the Breaker (Bandarion Keep).",
  "^spell_holy_sealofwisdom^Trainer: Blessing of Wisdom",
  "^spell_holy_auraoflight^Trainer: Retribution Aura",
  "^spell_holy_sealofvalor^Trainer: Blessing of Freedom",
  "^spell_holy_holysmite^Trainer: Smite, Lesser Heal, Power Word: Fortitude",
  "^spell_shadow_shadowwordpain^Trainer: Shadow Word: Pain",
  "^spell_holy_powerwordshield^Trainer: Power Word: Shield",
  "^spell_magic_lesserinvisibilty^Trainer: Fade, Renew",
  "^spell_shadow_unholyfrenzy^Trainer: Mind Blast, Resurrection, Racial 1 (class quest)",
  "Touch of Weakness (10): Undead racial quest. Pick it up from Aelthalyste (Undercity) or Miles Welsh (Spirit Rise). Reward: Touch of Weakness.",
  "^spell_holy_innerfire^Trainer: Inner Fire",
  "^spell_shadow_psychicscream^Trainer: Psychic Scream, Cure Disease",
  "^spell_holy_heal^Trainer: Heal",
  "^spell_holy_dispelmagic^Trainer: Dispel Magic",
  "Dark Sacrifice (20): Undead racial quest. Pick it up from Aelthalyste (Undercity), Miles Welsh (Spirit Rise) or Ur'kyo (Rocktusk Farm). Reward: Dark Sacrifice (lose health, gain mana).",
  "0{Undead Priest:} Horde. Touch of Weakness (10) and Dark Sacrifice ( 20: lose health, gain mana + Spirit), Cannibalize (usable in combat: very strong sustain), Will of the Forsaken, Touch of the Grave (30% drain on casters). DoubleZug: “Undead/Troll” for Horde leveling; CC: “Best”.",
  "^spell_shadow_ritualofsacrifice^Trainer: Sinister Strike, Eviscerate, Stealth",
  "^ability_backstab^Trainer: Backstab, Pick Pocket",
  "^ability_gouge^Trainer: Gouge",
  "^spell_shadow_shadowward^Trainer: Evasion",
  "^ability_dualwield^Trainer: Dual Wield, Sap, Slice and Dice, Sprint",
  "^ability_kick^Trainer: Kick, Parry",
  "^ability_warrior_riposte^Trainer: Expose Armor, Garrote",
  "^ability_rogue_feint^Trainer: Feint, Pick Lock",
  "^ability_rogue_ambush^Trainer: Ambush, Poised",
  "0{Undead Rogue:} Cannibalize (35% health from a corpse), Touch of the Grave (20% per hit, drains up to 5% of health), Will of the Forsaken. Method recommends it; Rogue's Diary: less downtime = steady leveling.",
  "^spell_shadow_ragingscream^Trainer: Demon Skin, Summon Imp, Shadow Bolt, Immolate",
  "Piercing the Veil (Undead, level 3): talk to Venya Marthand in Deathknell. Bring 3 Rattlecage Skull. Reward: Summon Imp .",
  "^spell_shadow_abominationexplosion^Trainer: Corruption, Curse of Weakness",
  "^spell_shadow_burningspirit^Trainer: Life Tap",
  "^spell_shadow_curseofsargeras^Trainer: Bane of Agony, Fear",
  "^spell_shadow_haunting^Trainer: Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, Summon Voidwalker",
  "Halgar's Summons (Undead, level 10): talk to Ageron Kargal in Brill, then to Carendin Halgar in Undercity. Then Creature of the Void: recover Egalin's Grimoire (Tirisfal ) and bring it to Halgar in the Temple of the Damned. Then The Binding: use the Runes of Summoning to summon and subjugate a Voidwalker, bring the runes back to Halgar in the Magic Quarter of Undercity. Reward: Summon Voidwalker .",
  "^spell_shadow_lifedrain^Trainer: Health Funnel",
  "^spell_shadow_lifedrain02^Trainer: Drain Life, Curse of Recklessness",
  "^spell_shadow_demonbreath^Trainer: Unending Breath",
  "^spell_fire_soulburn^Trainer: Searing Pain, Create Soulstone",
  "Devourer of Souls (Undead, Succubus): talk to Carendin Halgar in Undercity, then to Godrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned. Bring the hearts of Dalin Forgewright and Corma Villard to Halgar (Hearts of the Pure). Then The Binding: use the Pure Hearts to summon and subjugate a Succubus, bring the hearts back to Halgar in the Magic Quarter. Reward: Summon Succubus .",
  "Hearts of the Lovers (Undead, Incubus): bring the hearts of Avelina Lilly and Isaac Pearson to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned. Then The Binding: use the Lovers' Hearts to summon and subjugate an Incubus, bring the hearts back to Halgar in the Magic Quarter. Reward: Summon Incubus .",
  "0{Undead Warlock:} Undead (Horde): Cannibalize (7% HP+MP per second for 10 s on Humanoid/Undead corpses : less food/drink), Touch of the Grave (damage that heals you, including the DoTs' initial hit), Will of the Forsaken (removes Fear/Charm/Sleep, not immune), Underwater Breathing. Method: tier B, great for self-sustain.",
  "^ability_warrior_battleshout^Trainer: Battle Shout, Heroic Strike",
  "^ability_gouge^Trainer: Rend, Charge",
  "^spell_nature_thunderclap^Trainer: Thunder Clap",
  "^ability_shockwave^Trainer: Hamstring",
