  "^ability_warrior_disarm^Trainer: Disarm",
  "0{Undead Warrior:} Will of the Forsaken (2 min CD, removes Charm/Fear/Sleep), Cannibalize (7% HP and mana every 2 s for 10 s from Humanoid/Undead corpses: free heal), Touch of the Grave (30% chance to drain up to 5% max HP, 15 s CD), Underwater Breathing.",
