  "The Gift of Skysight (Ventaari Brightwish, Thendal Village): unlocks Skysight.",
  "6-slot bag (The Problem With Prideclaws): Indari Sunseam, Shen'dar Village. bag not verified.",
  "The Adventurer -> The Great Outdoors: The Adventurer from Aetheen of the Gales, then turn it in to Raan Wildwind, who gives The Great Outdoors (needs lvl 4).",
  "Skycutter from Valanaar: leave the island for Thunder Bluff from the right side of the Skydocks (58.2 79.5).",
  "Exploring the Horde (Thrall, Orgrimmar, lvl 13).",
  "Lessons Anew (Cure Poison) from Hana Lighthoof (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff): use Teleport: Moonglade and follow the chain with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven -> learn Cure Poison.",
