  "1Race: Skyborne Windshaper",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Druid:} Windshaper (Horde). Walk on Air, Wind Blessed, Elemental Insight, Skysight (+10–15% speed, 15 s, CD 2 min conflicting numbers). Method: Windshaper is great for Feral Cat and Balance thanks to haste. Zephras Isle, then trainer in Dalaran (Alfina Nightgaze) for the Horde.",
  "0{Walk on Air}\nActive new (shared with High Order): free Slow Fall with direction control, 90 s cooldown (was 2 min). (Warcraft Tavern, Oct 15 notes)",
  "0{Skysight}\nActive new (Windshaper only): +15% speed on foot and mounted for 15 s, 2 min cooldown, doesn't stack with other buffs. Used near an Elemental Convergence it gives Charged: +30% for 1 hour (persists through death, removed in raids). Castable while moving. (Blizzard Oct 26; the Wowhead tooltip is outdated: 10%/30 s)",
  "0{Wind Blessed}\nPassive : +2% Haste to spells, melee and ranged (was 3% until Oct 26).",
  "0{Elemental Insight}\nPassive : +5% damage vs Elementals.",
  "0Follow Constable Aonda's quest for Valanaar right away and don't forget the Simple Leather Satchel bag (The Problem With Prideclaws). Use the Blessing of Zephras tornadoes (+40% speed for 5 min, ends with any hostile action). After Valanaar take the right Skycutter (58.2 79.5) to Thunder Bluff.",
  "0~4–7 · {Simple Leather Satchel} · 6 · Quest The Problem With Prideclaws: Indari Sunseam (Shen'dar Village, Zephras Isle 44.6 44.6). Collect 10 Prideclaw Pelts. If it doesn't appear, first complete the village intro. (Warcraft Tavern walkthrough + LepreStore)",
  "05 · {Splintertree Post (Ashenvale)} · Vhulgra /way 73.2 61.6 · Arriving in Ashenvale (20-22 or 24-27). Inn: Innkeeper Kaylisk 74.0 60.6. (wmd + games.gg Sep 25)",
  "06 · {Zoram'gar Outpost (Ashenvale)} · Andruk /way 12.2 33.8 · Once you're west: hub for Blackfathom Deeps (Zoram Strand ~14 13) and the coastal quests.",
