  "^inv_spear_07^Trainer: Aimed Shot, Freezing Trap, Aspect of the Cheetah, Disengage",
  "^spell_frost_freezingbreath^Trainer: Frost Trap",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Hunter:} Windshaper (Horde): same Wind Blessed, Walk on Air and Elemental Insight; instead of Read Ley Line they have Skysight (+15% speed for 15 s, 30% with Charged to an elemental convergence). They start at Zephras Isle with the same Hunter quest.",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Rogue:} Windshapers: Wind Blessed (+2% Haste), Walk on Air, Skysight (+15% speed for 15 s every 2 min; with Elemental Convergence 'Charged' +30% for 1 hour). Rogue's Diary puts it in S-tier for leveling ('nothing comes close'); Warcraft Tavern considers it weak for the Rogue. Sources disagree ; verify in-game.",
  "^spell_nature_lightning^Trainer: Lightning Bolt, Rockbiter Weapon, Healing Wave",
  "Embracing the Elements (Skyborne): class quest from Rorian the Dayseeker (Zephras Isle), turn in to Windshaper Boro and continues into Call of Earth.",
  "^spell_nature_earthshock^Trainer: Earth Shock, Stoneskin Totem",
  "Call of Earth (Skyborne): talk to Windshaper Boro at Thendal Grove (Zephras Isle). Bring a Signet of Akir. Find the Rise of Spirits and drink the Earth Sapta. Bring the Rough Quartz to Boro. Reward: Earth Totem .",
  "^spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02^Trainer: Earthbind Totem",
  "^spell_nature_stoneclawtotem^Trainer: Stoneclaw Totem, Lightning Shield",
  "Call of Fire (Skyborne): talk to Aarnor Galestrike or Sessaria Skystride (Zephras Isle). Bring the Torch of the Dormant Flame to Olariaan Swiftburn (Shrine of Flames, Gustberry Lowlands). Kill Skypriest Faladiel (Gustberry Lowlands) and take Faladiel's Heart. Find Kuramaa in the house in Shen'dar Highlands, defeat the spirit and bring Kuramaa's Mask to Olariaan. Stay at the Brazier of Offering: Olariaan starts the ritual. Bring the Eternal Flame to Valanaar before the timer runs out. Reward: Fire Totem .",
  "^spell_nature_spiritwolf^Trainer: Ghost Wolf, Frost Shock, Frostbrand Weapon, Healing Stream Totem, Lesser Healing Wave, Call of the Elements, Totemic Recall",
  "Call of Water: from Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff), same chain as Tauren: Islen Waterseer in the Barrens -> Brine -> 3 waterskins -> Vial of Purest Water -> Shard of Water to Islen -> Water Totem.",
  "^spell_fireresistancetotem_01^Trainer: Fire Resistance Totem, Flametongue Totem",
  "Call of Air: from Xanis Flameweaver (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff), then Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles -> Air Totem.",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Shaman:} Horde (Windshaper), Zephras Isle: Walk on Air (slow fall), Skysight +15% speed 15 s (30% with Charged for 1 h near an elemental convergence), Wind Blessed +2% Haste, Elemental Insight +5% damage to Elementals. Trainer: Windshaper Boro (Thendal Village 42.8, 23.6). Rankedboost (snippet): B.",
  "^ability_warrior_decisivestrike^Trainer: Slam, Cleave, Victory Rush, Retaliation, Dual Wield",
  "^ability_warrior_shieldwall^Trainer: Shield Wall",
  "0{Skyborne Windshaper Warrior:} Windshaper: Wind Blessed, Elemental Insight, Walk on Air and Skysight (+15% speed 15 s, 30% if Charged, 2 min CD) instead of Read Ley Line.",
 },
}
