    { { "Songblade Search", "Dorin Songblade, Lakeshire (25.6 46.6)" }, { "Lost in the Thicket Things", "Caitlin Grassman, Menethil Harbor (11.9 58.8)" }, { "Highland Hides", "James Halloran, Menethil Harbor (8.6 55.7), after Young Crocolisk Skins" }, { "Horrors in the Highland", "Rethiel the Greenwarden, Wetlands (56.3 40.3), after Tramping Paws, Fire Taboo and Blisters on the Land" }, { "Lost Relic Carry", "Titan Relic, dropped by Relic Guardian" } },
    {  } },
   { "City of Dalaran", 28, 33, "go", "30–33", "Once, after the key chain: each quest is worth 3,950 XP. Do the chain while questing in Hillsbrad Foothills.", "Entrance through the sewers in Silverpine Forest (69.3 45.6); the city is in Alterac Mountains.",
